30856      title 'Spatial Correlation Analysis with PROC VARIOGRAM';
30857      ods graphics on;
30858      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick plots=pairs(thr=30);
30859      compute novariogram nhc=20;
30860      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30861      var Thick;
30862      run;

NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed page 1924.

30863      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv;
30864      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 cl robust;
30865      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30866      var Thick;
30867      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 9 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1925-1926.

30868      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv plots(only)=moran;
30869      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 autocorr(assum=random);
30870      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30871      var Thick;
30872      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
